// Article 4. The trustee's duties.
#require "3-incapacity.charter".
Fact asset Identified by Cottage

Act mix-with-own-property Actor person Holds when False

Event year-ends
Duty annual-account Holder person Claimant person'
  Due within 60
Act account Actor person
  Holds when trustee(person)
  Terminates (Foreach person': annual-account(person, person'))
Extend Event year-ends
  Creates (Foreach person, person': annual-account(person, person')
             When trustee(person) && (person' == Anna || person' == Ben))

Fact consented Identified by person * asset
Act consent-to-sale Actor person Related to asset Creates consented(person, asset)
Fact sold-to-trustee Identified by asset
Power buy-from-trust Actor person Related to asset
  Holds when trustee(person)
  Valid when trustee(person) && consented(Anna, asset) && consented(Ben, asset)
  Creates sold-to-trustee(asset)

Clause 4.1 Approved "ce0ea48fa1fb84ef4504840dfc2ad3076668ac0d623743beaef940df906b421a"
  Norm "The trustee may not mix trust property with the trustee's own property." => mix-with-own-property
Clause 4.2 Approved "cb785d91166d3641244b36cd216a799968c6abfeeda813e9137e407c846b1400"
  Norm "The trustee accounts to the beneficiaries within sixty days after the end of each year." => annual-account, account
Clause 4.3 Approved "a3a1e7a80d832abcc337e0eb56a8210ec8731b1d75cb9cd4d4818bf14dbba86a"
  Norm "A sale of trust property to the trustee is void unless every beneficiary consents to it." => buy-from-trust, consent-to-sale
.
